{"txn": 12, "events": [{"seq": 20, "kind": "package_stored", "payload": {"package_id": "dep-20456df179", "item_id": "wi-36493e594e", "content_hash": "4fcda604b3d7c8837f2a2025b2dc4d4562aaa5d2d7f3cd5b63ca710868932510", "content_preview": "## 反馈分析结论\n\n1. **更新后稳定性问题严重**：闪退频发（主要触发场景为打开聊天记录），并伴随发热、耗电加快；最新补丁后有所好转。证据：#1、#5、#10（辅证 #4、#8）\n\n2. **夜间模式可用性缺陷**：对比度低、自动切换时间不准，影响使用体验。证据：#2、#6\n\n3. **客服体系响应失效**：工单积压、机器人答非所问、整体响应变慢，服务满意度下滑。证据：#3、#7、#12\n\n", "source_refs": [], "size": 321, "artifact_ref": "4fcda604b3d7c8837f2a2025b2dc4d4562aaa5d2d7f3cd5b63ca710868932510.txt", "stage": "submission", "submission_id": "submission-ffd4f08158", "node_id": "node-18c5e555b1", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-9be35e0333"}, "ts": 1789097209.3163624}, {"seq": 21, "kind": "work_item_submitted", "payload": {"item_id": "wi-36493e594e", "submission_id": "submission-ffd4f08158", "node_id": "node-18c5e555b1", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-9be35e0333", "output_sha256": "4fcda604b3d7c8837f2a2025b2dc4d4562aaa5d2d7f3cd5b63ca710868932510", "package_id": "dep-20456df179"}, "ts": 1789097209.3166604}]}
